      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Boyer-Moore vote (2 slots)</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/majority-element-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 229</a></div>\n  <h1>Majority Element II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: at most two values can each own more than a third of the array, so keep two candidates and throw away triples of three different values; the survivors are the only possible answers, and a second counting pass confirms them. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
